    "spell_resistance_raw": "yes (harmless)",
    "description_raw": "Planar adaptation grants you immunity to the harmful environmental effects of a particular plane of existence, including such hazards as toxicity, extreme temperatures, and lack of air. Additionally, you gain energy resistance 20 to a single energy type prevalent on that plane (choose one if more than one type is equally prevalent). Planar adaptation has no effect when cast upon your native plane.\nPlanar Adaptation, Mass\n\nSchool transmutation; Level cleric/oracle 6, sorcerer/wizard 7, summoner/unchained summoner 6; Elemental School air 7, earth 7, fire 7, water 7",
